  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Project Scope**\n\nOkay, I\'m now zeroing in on the project\'s parameters. I\'ve got the hero landing page specifications locked down. It\'s NORVA \342\200\223 The New Standard in Staffing. We\'re going with plain HTML, CSS, and JS. No frameworks, no build step. The media specs for desktop are set; focusing on the scroll-driven single-file experience.\n\n\n**Specifying Asset Implementation**\n\nI\'m now nailing down the implementation details for the video assets. I\'ve got the mobile and desktop clips, plus the poster image. The city visuals are strictly from the video; nothing in the code will draw or animate anything city-related. No opacity transitions in the clip itself either. I\'m choosing Inter Tight for the font. I have the necessary Google Fonts link, and I\'ve got the specific headline, body, and UI label styles locked in.\n\n\n**Defining the Unit System**\n\nI\'m now establishing the unit system and color palette for consistent styling.  I\'ve decided on a `u` unit tied to viewport dimensions and specified colors for the project. I\'ve defined the CSS for a `clamp()`-based `u` and detailed the color values I will need. I have also begun working through the layout using these newly-defined units.\n\n\n**Detailing the Landing Experience**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the finer details of the landing experience. The hero will sport a bottom-aligned headline and subline, along with a scroll cue, all meticulously styled with the established unit system. The subline text is set, with specific weights, sizes, and colors. The scroll cue will appear as an underlined, fading line at the bottom, guiding users with a defined fade-out and animation.\n\n\n\n**Refining Component Interactions**\n\nI\'m now detailing the interactions for the modular rows. Each row will rise, fade in, and then expand based on scroll position. Inactive rows feature a subtle number and title, whereas active rows will expand with an opaque number and grow the title. The paragraph opens with a left border when active, all with specific CSS transitions, calculations, and colors.\n\n\n**Calculating Scene Dynamics**\n\nI\'m now calculating the scene dynamics and interactions. Steps 1-4, which each describe a crew process, will expand on the scroll. Step 01 is active below paragraph .62, and Step 02 is active above it. The scene will be a sticky 100vh with a video. I\'m calculating the video\'s seek time based on scroll progress and clamping the video seeking to stay sharp and synchronized. I\'m also planning the headline transform with the calculations I need to stay sharp.\n\n\n**Implementing Visual Logic**\n\nI\'m now implementing the visual logic for the hero. I have the easing function ready and have implemented the headline style. I\'ve calculated the opacity logic. The loader\'s design is complete, with a full-screen night panel and detailed elements like dotted ellipses and a chevron. I am working on the spinning animation and fade-out behavior, also considering reduced motion preferences.\n\n\n**Defining Mobile Interactions**\n\nI\'m now detailing the interactions for the mobile view. The UI still scrolls as expected. I\'m building out a \"recorder mode\" to test animations, where a 6.5s animation drives `p`. I\'m calculating and syncing clip times on `window.__recTime`. I\'m setting `u = 1px` for phones. I\'m also addressing navigation and content styling.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7167258102629693619"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover\\\">\\n  <title>NORVA \342\200\224 The New Standard in Staffing</title>\\n  <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\\\">\\n  <link rel=\\\"preconnect\\\" href=\\\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\\\" crossorigin>\\n  <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter+Tight:ital,wght@0,300..900;1,300..900&display=swap\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root {\\n      --u: clamp(0.72px, min(calc(100vw / 1440), calc(100vh / 960)), 1.5px);\\n      --night: #0f1626;\\n      --ink: #f4f6fa;\\n      --ink-72: rgba(244, 246, 250, 0.72);\\n      --ink-46: rgba(244, 246, 250, 0.46);\\n      --pill-grey: #2a3245;\\n      --lime: #c6ff2e;\\n      --cyan: #3fd8ff;\\n      --hairline: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);\\n      --vh: 1vh;\\n    }\\n\\n    * {\\n      box-sizing: border-box;\\n      margin: 0;\\n      padding: 0;\\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\\n      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\\n    }\\n\\n    html, body {\\n      background-color: var(--night);\\n      color: var(--ink);\\n      font-family: \'Inter Tight\', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\\n      overflow-x: hidden;\\n      width: 100%;\\n      height: auto;\\n      scroll-behavior: auto;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Scroll track */\\n    .scroll-track {\\n      position: relative;\\n      width: 100%;\\n      height: 420vh;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Sticky viewport container */\\n    .viewport-stage {\\n      position: sticky;\\n      top: 0;\\n      left: 0;\\n      width: 100vw;\\n      height: 100vh;\\n      height: calc(var(--vh, 1vh) * 100);\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      perspective: calc(900 * var(--u));\\n      background-color: var(--night);\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Video element */\\n    .scene-video {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      top: 0;\\n      left: 0;\\n      width: 100%;\\n      height: 100%;\\n      object-fit: cover;\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n      z-index: 1;\\n      will-change: transform;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Gradient overlay for text legibility */\\n    .scene-shade {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: 0;\\n      background: linear-gradient(\\n        180deg,\\n        rgba(15, 22, 38, 0.55) 0%,\\n        rgba(15, 22, 38, 0) 34%,\\n        rgba(15, 22, 38, 0) 70%,\\n        rgba(15, 22, 38, 0.50) 100%\\n      );\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n      z-index: 2;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Fixed Navigation */\\n    .nav-bar {\\n      position: fixed;\\n      top: 0;\\n      left: 0;\\n      right: 0;\\n      height: calc(58 * var(--u));\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      padding: 0 calc(36 * var(--u));\\n      z-index: 50;\\n      pointer-events: auto;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-left {\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: calc(24 * var(--u));\\n      flex: 1;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-link {\\n      font-size: calc(11.5 * var(--u));\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.06em;\\n      color: var(--ink-72);\\n      text-decoration: none;\\n      transition: color 0.2s ease;\\n      cursor: pointer;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-link:hover {\\n      color: var(--ink);\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-center {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      left: 50%;\\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\\n      font-size: calc(19 * var(--u));\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.06em;\\n      color: var(--ink);\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      cursor: default;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-right {\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: calc(12 * var(--u));\\n      justify-content: flex-end;\\n      flex: 1;\\n    }\\n\\n    .pill-btn {\\n      height: calc(40 * var(--u));\\n      padding: 0 calc(20 * var(--u));\\n      border-radius: 9999px;\\n      font-size: calc(11 * var(--u));\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      border: none;\\n      cursor: pointer;\\n      text-decoration: none;\\n      transition: transform 0.15s ease, background-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\\n      will-change: transform;\\n    }\\n\\n    .pill-btn:hover {\\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\\n    }\\n\\n    .pill-btn.grey {\\n      background-color: var(--pill-grey);\\n      color: var(--ink);\\n    }\\n\\n    .pill-btn.grey:hover {\\n      background-color: #353f57;\\n    }\\n\\n    .pill-btn.lime {\\n      background-color: var(--lime);\\n      color: var(--night);\\n      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(198, 255, 46, 0.2);\\n    }\\n\\n    .pill-btn.lime:hover {\\n      background-color: #d2ff4a;\\n      box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(198, 255, 46, 0.4);\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Hero Copy Section */\\n    .hero-stage {\\n      position: fixed;\\n      top: calc(92 * var(--u));\\n      left: 0;\\n      right: 0;\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      text-align: center;\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n      z-index: 10;\\n      transform-style: preserve-3d;\\n      transform-origin: 50% 100%;\\n      will-change: transform, opacity;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-headline {\\n      font-size: calc(84 * var(--u));\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      line-height: 0.96;\\n      letter-spacing: -0.045em;\\n      color: var(--ink);\\n      margin-bottom: calc(24 * var(--u));\\n      text-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(15, 22, 38, 0.8);\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-subline {\\n      font-size: calc(18 * var(--u));\\n      font-weight: 400;\\n      line-height: 1.45;\\n      color: var(--ink-72);\\n      max-width: calc(720 * var(--u));\\n      text-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgba(15, 22, 38, 0.8);\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Scroll Cue */\\n    .scroll-cue {\\n      position: fixed;\\n      bottom: calc(36 * var(--u));\\n      left: 50%;\\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n      z-index: 20;\\n      will-change: opacity;\\n    }\\n\\n    .scroll-cue-text {\\n      font-size: calc(11.5 * var(--u));\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.06em;\\n      color: var(--ink-72);\\n      margin-bottom: calc(6 * var(--u));\\n    }\\n\\n    .scroll-cue-line-track {\\n      width: 100%;\\n      height: 1px;\\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\\n      position: relative;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n    }\\n\\n    .scroll-cue-line-fill {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      top: 0;\\n      left: 0;\\n      height: 100%;\\n      width: 100%;\\n      background: var(--ink);\\n      transform-origin: left center;\\n      will-change: transform;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Process List (Bottom Left) */\\n    .process-container {\\n      position: fixed;\\n      left: calc(36 * var(--u));\\n      bottom: calc(28 * var(--u));\\n      width: calc(430 * var(--u));\\n      z-index: 25;\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      gap: calc(12 * var(--u));\\n      pointer-events: auto;\\n      will-change: transform, opacity;\\n    }\\n\\n    .process-row {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      border-radius: calc(10 * var(--u));\\n      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\\n      cursor: pointer;\\n    }\\n\\n    .process-header {\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: calc(14 * var(--u));\\n      padding: calc(6 * var(--u)) 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    .process-num-cell {\\n      width: calc(36 * var(--u));\\n      height: calc(36 * var(--u));\\n      border-radius: calc(8 * var(--u));\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      font-size: calc(12.5 * var(--u));\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\\n      border: 1px solid var(--hairline);\\n      color: var(--ink-72);\\n      transition: background-color 0.35s ease, color 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease;\\n      flex-shrink: 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    .process-row.active .process-num-cell {\\n      background: #ffffff;\\n      color: var(--night);\\n      border-color: #ffffff;\\n      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\\n    }\\n\\n    .process-title {\\n      font-size: calc(12.5 * var(--u));\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      color: var(--ink-72);\\n      letter-spacing: -0.01em;\\n      transition: font-size 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), color 0.35s ease;\\n    }\\n\\n    .process-row.active .process-title {\\n      font-size: calc(18 * var(--u));\\n      color: var(--ink);\\n    }\\n\\n    .process-body-wrapper {\\n      display: grid;\\n      grid-template-rows: 0fr;\\n      transition: grid-template-rows 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      margin-left: calc(18 * var(--u));\\n      padding-left: calc(26 * var(--u));\\n      border-left: 1px solid var(--hairline);\\n    }\\n\\n    .process-row.active .process-body-wrapper {\\n      grid-template-rows: 1fr;\\n    }\\n\\n    .process-body-content {\\n      min-height: 0;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      padding-top: calc(8 * var(--u));\\n      padding-bottom: calc(10 * var(--u));\\n      font-size: calc(13 * var(--u));\\n      line-height: 1.5;\\n      color: var(--ink-72);\\n      font-weight: 400;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Full-screen Loading Panel */\\n    .loader-panel {\\n      position: fixed;\\n      inset: 0;\\n      background-color: var(--night);\\n      z-index: 1000;\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      transition: opacity 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), visibility 0.6s;\\n    }\\n\\n    .loader-panel.hidden {\\n      opacity: 0;\\n      visibility: hidden;\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n    }\\n\\n    .loader-orb-wrap {\\n      position: relative;\\n      width: 240px;\\n      height: 240px;\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Ellipses */\\n    .loader-ellipse-wide {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      width: 220px;\\n      height: 120px;\\n      border: 1.5px dashed rgba(63, 216, 255, 0.35);\\n      border-radius: 50%;\\n      transform: rotate(-25deg);\\n      animation: orbitPulse 3.2s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\\n    }\\n\\n    .loader-ellipse-circ {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      width: 170px;\\n      height: 170px;\\n      border: 1.5px dotted rgba(198, 255, 46, 0.35);\\n      border-radius: 50%;\\n      animation: orbitPulseCirc 4.5s linear infinite;\\n    }\\n\\n    @keyframes orbitPulse {\\n      0% { transform: rotate(-25deg) scale(0.96); opacity: 0.4; }\\n      100% { transform: rotate(-20deg) scale(1.04); opacity: 0.9; }\\n    }\\n\\n    @keyframes orbitPulseCirc {\\n      0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }\\n      100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Spinner mark */\\n    .loader-mark {\\n      position: relative;\\n      width: 70px;\\n      height: 70px;\\n      animation: markSpin 1.6s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) infinite;\\n    }\\n\\n    @keyframes markSpin {\\n      0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }\\n      100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }\\n    }\\n\\n    .mark-ring {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    .ring-sq {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      width: 9px;\\n      height: 9px;\\n      background: var(--cyan);\\n      border-radius: 1.5px;\\n      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--cyan);\\n    }\\n\\n    .ring-sq:nth-child(1) { top: 2px; left: 30.5px; }\\n    .ring-sq:nth-child(2) { top: 16px; right: 5px; }\\n    .ring-sq:nth-child(3) { bottom: 16px; right: 5px; }\\n    .ring-sq:nth-child(4) { bottom: 2px; left: 30.5px; }\\n    .ring-sq:nth-child(5) { bottom: 16px; left: 5px; }\\n    .ring-sq:nth-child(6) { top: 16px; left: 5px; }\\n\\n    .mark-chevron {\\n      position: absolute;\\n      top: 50%;\\n      left: 50%;\\n      width: 16px;\\n      height: 16px;\\n      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\\n      border-top: 3.5px solid var(--lime);\\n      border-right: 3.5px solid var(--lime);\\n      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px var(--lime));\\n      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(45deg);\\n    }\\n\\n    .loader-caption {\\n      margin-top: 24px;\\n      font-size: 11.5px;\\n      font-weight: 600;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.08em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      color: var(--ink-72);\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Reduced motion query */\\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\\n      .loader-ellipse-wide,\\n      .loader-ellipse-circ,\\n      .loader-mark {\\n        animation: none !important;\\n      }\\n      .process-body-wrapper,\\n      .process-title,\\n      .process-num-cell,\\n      .pill-btn {\\n        transition: none !important;\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Phone / Tablet responsive styles */\\n    @media (max-width: 760px) {\\n      :root {\\n        --u: 1px;\\n      }\\n\\n      .nav-bar {\\n        height: 52px;\\n        padding: 0 18px;\\n      }\\n\\n      .nav-left {\\n        display: none;\\n      }\\n\\n      .nav-center {\\n        position: static;\\n        transform: none;\\n        font-size: 18px;\\n        flex: 1;\\n      }\\n\\n      .nav-right {\\n        gap: 8px;\\n        flex: initial;\\n      }\\n\\n      .pill-btn {\\n        height: 34px;\\n        padding: 0 14px;\\n        font-size: 10px;\\n      }\\n\\n      .hero-stage {\\n        top: 96px;\\n        padding: 0 20px;\\n      }\\n\\n      .hero-headline {\\n        font-size: clamp(38px, 11vw, 48px);\\n        line-height: 1.02;\\n        margin-bottom: 16px;\\n      }\\n\\n      .hero-subline {\\n        font-size: 15px;\\n        line-height: 1.4;\\n        max-width: 34ch;\\n      }\\n\\n      .process-container {\\n        left: 18px;\\n        right: 18px;\\n        width: auto;\\n        bottom: 22px;\\n        gap: 8px;\\n      }\\n\\n      .process-num-cell {\\n        width: 32px;\\n        height: 32px;\\n        font-size: 11px;\\n      }\\n\\n      .process-title {\\n        font-size: 12px;\\n      }\\n\\n      .process-row.active .process-title {\\n        font-size: 15px;\\n      }\\n\\n      .process-body-content {\\n        font-size: 12px;\\n        line-height: 1.45;\\n      }\\n\\n      .scroll-cue {\\n        bottom: 24px;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n\\n  <!-- Fullscreen Loading Screen -->\\n  <div class=\\\"loader-panel\\\" id=\\\"loader-panel\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"loader-orb-wrap\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"loader-ellipse-wide\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"loader-ellipse-circ\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"loader-mark\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"mark-ring\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"ring-sq\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"ring-sq\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"ring-sq\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"ring-sq\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"ring-sq\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"ring-sq\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"mark-chevron\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"loader-caption\\\">Mobilizing Isometric City</div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Navigation -->\\n  <header class=\\\"nav-bar\\\">\\n    <nav class=\\\"nav-left\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"nav-link\\\" href=\\\"#industries\\\">OUR INDUSTRIES</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"nav-link\\\" href=\\\"#mission\\\">OUR MISSION</a>\\n    </nav>\\n    <div class=\\\"nav-center\\\">NORVA</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"nav-right\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"pill-btn grey\\\" href=\\\"#apply\\\">APPLY</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"pill-btn lime\\\" href=\\\"#request\\\">REQUEST CREWS</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Scroll Track & Sticky Scene -->\\n  <main class=\\\"scroll-track\\\" id=\\\"scroll-track\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"viewport-stage\\\" id=\\\"viewport-stage\\\">\\n      <!-- Video Element with desktop and mobile media queries -->\\n      <video\\n        class=\\\"scene-video\\\"\\n        id=\\\"glide-video\\\"\\n        playsinline\\n        webkit-playsinline\\n        muted\\n        preload=\\\"auto\\\"\\n        poster=\\\"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_38xzZboKViGWJOttwIXH07lWA1P/33150b94-09f7-47da-a7c9-3ae76c2dd7eb.jpg\\\"\\n      >\\n        <source\\n          media=\\\"(max-width: 900px)\\\"\\n          src=\\\"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_38xzZboKViGWJOttwIXH07lWA1P/9a30e5e9-9f03-4755-9bc1-7bcf1510aab3.mp4\\\"\\n          type=\\\"video/mp4\\\"\\n        />\\n        <source\\n          src=\\\"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_38xzZboKViGWJOttwIXH07lWA1P/65fdef53-5686-4659-8761-52d61bf1a4f7.mp4\\\"\\n          type=\\\"video/mp4\\\"\\n        />\\n      </video>\\n\\n      <!-- Gradient legibility shade -->\\n      <div class=\\\"scene-shade\\\"></div>\\n\\n      <!-- Hero Copy -->\\n      <section class=\\\"hero-stage\\\" id=\\\"hero-stage\\\">\\n        <h1 class=\\\"hero-headline\\\">The New Standard<br>in Staffing</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"hero-subline\\\">\\n          AI driven speed. Expert curation.<br>\\n          We mobilize verified crews to protect your schedule and<br>\\n          your bottom line in high-consequence environments.\\n        </p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- Scroll Cue -->\\n      <div class=\\\"scroll-cue\\\" id=\\\"scroll-cue\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"scroll-cue-text\\\">SCROLL TO DISCOVER OUR PROCESS</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"scroll-cue-line-track\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"scroll-cue-line-fill\\\" id=\\\"scroll-cue-fill\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Process List -->\\n      <aside class=\\\"process-container\\\" id=\\\"process-container\\\" aria-label=\\\"Process Steps\\\">\\n        <!-- Row 01 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"process-row active\\\" id=\\\"process-row-1\\\" data-step=\\\"1\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"process-header\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"process-num-cell\\\">01</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"process-title\\\">Activation, simplified</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"process-body-wrapper\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"process-body-content\\\">\\n              One call starts mobilization. Craft, headcount and start date go straight to our vetted crews. No hand-offs. No escalations. Just boots on site within minutes.\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Row 02 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"process-row\\\" id=\\\"process-row-2\\\" data-step=\\\"2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"process-header\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"process-num-cell\\\">02</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"process-title\\\">Cleared to count</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"process-body-wrapper\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"process-body-content\\\">\\n              Every worker is screened before dispatch: compliance, background, certifications and fitness for duty, so the whole crew clears the gate on day one.\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Row 03 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"process-row\\\" id=\\\"process-row-3\\\" data-step=\\\"3\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"process-header\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"process-num-cell\\\">03</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"process-title\\\">Proven field match</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"process-body-wrapper\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"process-body-content\\\">\\n              Skill-matrix verification pairs precision technical requirements with field-tested tradespeople, reducing turnover and friction across critical paths.\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Row 04 -->\\n        <div class=\\\"process-row\\\" id=\\\"process-row-4\\\" data-step=\\\"4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"process-header\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"process-num-cell\\\">04</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"process-title\\\">Seamless arrival</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"process-body-wrapper\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"process-body-content\\\">\\n              Real-time gate telemetry, digital badges, and dedicated on-site logistics ensure complete crew presence ready for immediate shift briefing.\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    (function () {\\n      \'use strict\';\\n\\n      // Elements\\n      const track = document.getElementById(\'scroll-track\');\\n      const video = document.getElementById(\'glide-video\');\\n      const heroStage = document.getElementById(\'hero-stage\');\\n      const scrollCue = document.getElementById(\'scroll-cue\');\\n      const scrollCueFill = document.getElementById(\'scroll-cue-fill\');\\n      const processContainer = document.getElementById(\'process-container\');\\n      const loader = document.getElementById(\'loader-panel\');\\n      const rows = [\\n        document.getElementById(\'process-row-1\'),\\n        document.getElementById(\'process-row-2\'),\\n        document.getElementById(\'process-row-3\'),\\n        document.getElementById(\'process-row-4\')\\n      ];\\n\\n      // Update CSS viewport height helper\\n      function updateVh() {\\n        const vh = window.innerHeight * 0.01;\\n        document.documentElement.style.setProperty(\'--vh\', `${vh}px`);\\n      }\\n      updateVh();\\n      window.addEventListener(\'resize\', updateVh);\\n\\n      // Check URL search parameters for recorder mode\\n      const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\\n      const isRecorder = urlParams.get(\'rec\') === \'1\';\\n\\n      // Fallback video duration\\n      let videoDuration = 5.04;\\n      if (video.duration && !isNaN(video.duration)) {\\n        videoDuration = video.duration;\\n      }\\n      video.addEventListener(\'loadedmetadata\', function () {\\n        if (video.duration && !isNaN(video.duration)) {\\n          videoDuration = video.duration;\\n        }\\n      });\\n\\n      // Loader logic\\n      let loaderDismissed = false;\\n      function dismissLoader() {\\n        if (loaderDismissed) return;\\n        loaderDismissed = true;\\n        if (loader) {\\n          loader.classList.add(\'hidden\');\\n          setTimeout(() => {\\n            if (loader.parentNode) loader.parentNode.removeChild(loader);\\n          }, 650);\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      if (isRecorder) {\\n        dismissLoader();\\n      } else {\\n        // Video first frame loaded\\n        video.addEventListener(\'loadeddata\', () => {\\n          setTimeout(dismissLoader, 350);\\n        });\\n        video.addEventListener(\'canplay\', () => {\\n          setTimeout(dismissLoader, 350);\\n        });\\n        // Max timeout fallback: 3.5s\\n        setTimeout(dismissLoader, 3500);\\n      }\\n\\n      // Easing function\\n      function easeInOutQuad(t) {\\n        return t < 0.5 ? 2 * t * t : 1 - Math.pow(-2 * t + 2, 2) / 2;\\n      }\\n\\n      function clamp(val, min, max) {\\n        return Math.min(Math.max(val, min), max);\\n      }\\n\\n      // State variables\\n      let targetProgress = 0;\\n      let smoothProgress = 0;\\n      let targetTime = 0;\\n      let currentTime = 0;\\n      let isSeeking = false;\\n      let pendingTime = null;\\n\\n      // Handle seeked events to ensure sharp, synchronized frame display\\n      video.addEventListener(\'seeked\', () => {\\n        isSeeking = false;\\n        if (pendingTime !== null) {\\n          const next = pendingTime;\\n          pendingTime = null;\\n          attemptSeek(next);\\n        }\\n      });\\n\\n      function attemptSeek(t) {\\n        if (!video || isNaN(video.duration)) return;\\n        const boundedTime = clamp(t, 0, videoDuration - 1 / 48);\\n        if (isSeeking) {\\n          pendingTime = boundedTime;\\n        } else {\\n          if (Math.abs(video.currentTime - boundedTime) > (1 / 60)) {\\n            isSeeking = true;\\n            try {\\n              video.currentTime = boundedTime;\\n            } catch (e) {\\n              isSeeking = false;\\n            }\\n          }\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      // Pure function of p for UI state\\n      function updateUI(p) {\\n        // 1. Headline block:\\n        // with h = easeInOutQuad(p / .38)\\n        const tHeadline = clamp(p / 0.38, 0, 1);\\n        const h = easeInOutQuad(tHeadline);\\n        // apply translateY(-34h vh) rotateX(62h deg) scale(1 - .12h) around bottom edge\\n        const vhVal = window.innerHeight * 0.01;\\n        const translateY = -34 * h * vhVal;\\n        const rotateX = 62 * h;\\n        const scale = 1 - 0.12 * h;\\n        heroStage.style.transform = `translateY(${translateY}px) rotateX(${rotateX}deg) scale(${scale})`;\\n\\n        // Opacity falls from 1 to 0 between p .10 and .24\\n        let headlineOpacity = 1;\\n        if (p <= 0.10) {\\n          headlineOpacity = 1;\\n        } else if (p >= 0.24) {\\n          headlineOpacity = 0;\\n        } else {\\n          headlineOpacity = 1 - (p - 0.10) / (0.24 - 0.10);\\n        }\\n        heroStage.style.opacity = headlineOpacity;\\n        heroStage.style.visibility = headlineOpacity <= 0.001 ? \'hidden\' : \'visible\';\\n\\n        // 2. Scroll cue:\\n        // underline drains over the first 10%\\n        const drain = clamp(1 - (p / 0.10), 0, 1);\\n        scrollCueFill.style.transform = `scaleX(${drain})`;\\n\\n        // Cue fades out between p .04 and .12\\n        let cueOpacity = 1;\\n        if (p <= 0.04) {\\n          cueOpacity = 1;\\n        } else if (p >= 0.12) {\\n          cueOpacity = 0;\\n        } else {\\n          cueOpacity = 1 - (p - 0.04) / (0.12 - 0.04);\\n        }\\n        scrollCue.style.opacity = cueOpacity;\\n        scrollCue.style.visibility = cueOpacity <= 0.001 ? \'hidden\' : \'visible\';\\n\\n        // 3. Process list:\\n        // rises 40px and fades in between p .08 and .24\\n        let processOpacity = 0;\\n        if (p <= 0.08) {\\n          processOpacity = 0;\\n        } else if (p >= 0.24) {\\n          processOpacity = 1;\\n        } else {\\n          processOpacity = (p - 0.08) / (0.24 - 0.08);\\n        }\\n        const processTranslateY = (1 - processOpacity) * 40;\\n        processContainer.style.opacity = processOpacity;\\n        processContainer.style.transform = `translateY(${processTranslateY}px)`;\\n        processContainer.style.visibility = processOpacity <= 0.001 ? \'hidden\' : \'visible\';\\n\\n        // Step 01 is active below p .62, and step 02 above it\\n        const activeIndex = p < 0.62 ? 0 : 1;\\n        rows.forEach((row, idx) => {\\n          if (idx === activeIndex) {\\n            row.classList.add(\'active\');\\n          } else {\\n            row.classList.remove(\'active\');\\n          }\\n        });\\n      }\\n\\n      // Check reduced motion preference\\n      const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia(\'(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\').matches;\\n\\n      // Animation loop\\n      function onFrame() {\\n        if (!isRecorder) {\\n          // Calculate raw scroll progress\\n          const rect = track.getBoundingClientRect();\\n          const totalScrollable = track.offsetHeight - window.innerHeight;\\n          const currentScrolled = -rect.top;\\n          const rawP = totalScrollable > 0 ? clamp(currentScrolled / totalScrollable, 0, 1) : 0;\\n          targetProgress = rawP;\\n\\n          if (prefersReducedMotion) {\\n            smoothProgress = targetProgress;\\n            currentTime = targetProgress * (videoDuration - 1 / 48);\\n          } else {\\n            smoothProgress += (targetProgress - smoothProgress) * 0.2;\\n            targetTime = smoothProgress * (videoDuration - 1 / 48);\\n            currentTime += (targetTime - currentTime) * 0.2;\\n          }\\n\\n          attemptSeek(currentTime);\\n          updateUI(smoothProgress);\\n        }\\n\\n        requestAnimationFrame(onFrame);\\n      }\\n      requestAnimationFrame(onFrame);\\n\\n      // Manual interaction with process items\\n      rows.forEach((row, i) => {\\n        row.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\\n          const targetP = i === 0 ? 0.35 : 0.75;\\n          const totalScrollable = track.offsetHeight - window.innerHeight;\\n          window.scrollTo({\\n            top: targetP * totalScrollable,\\n            behavior: prefersReducedMotion ? \'auto\' : \'smooth\'\\n          });\\n        });\\n      });\\n\\n      // Recorder mode support (6.5 s animation driving p)\\n      if (isRecorder) {\\n        let startTime = performance.now();\\n        const hold1 = 550; // 0.55s\\n        const glide = 5040; // 5.04s\\n        const total = 6500; // 6.5s\\n\\n        function recorderStep(now) {\\n          const elapsed = now - startTime;\\n          let p = 0;\\n          if (elapsed <= hold1) {\\n            p = 0;\\n          } else if (elapsed <= hold1 + glide) {\\n            p = (elapsed - hold1) / glide;\\n          } else {\\n            p = 1;\\n          }\\n          p = clamp(p, 0, 1);\\n          const t = p * (videoDuration - 1 / 48);\\n          if (video && !isNaN(video.duration)) {\\n            try { video.currentTime = t; } catch (e) {}\\n          }\\n          updateUI(p);\\n          if (elapsed < total) {\\n            requestAnimationFrame(recorderStep);\\n          }\\n        }\\n        requestAnimationFrame(recorderStep);\\n      }\\n\\n      // Global helper for recorder API\\n      window.__recTime = function (vid, t) {\\n        const v = vid || video;\\n        const dur = (v && v.duration && !isNaN(v.duration)) ? v.duration : videoDuration;\\n        const p = clamp(t / (dur - 1 / 48), 0, 1);\\n        const totalScrollable = track.offsetHeight - window.innerHeight;\\n        window.scrollTo(0, p * totalScrollable);\\n        if (v) {\\n          try { v.currentTime = t; } catch (e) {}\\n        }\\n        updateUI(p);\\n        return v ? v.currentTime : t;\\n      };\\n\\n    })();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create NORVA single-file scroll-driven hero landing page in Android assets\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/main/assets/index.html\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing landing page asset\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create app/src/main/assets/index.html\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\317R\n\314R\001i\024}\023\250\370\345KS\250\340D;jY\214\364\334\3162\026\031\203&\224@m\375-\304\033_\355R\265\"\313\326\371\341\222&\024U\277\n\232\003#\232`\255@\255\234\326\231\357\271\271U\211\0253\313\230\251<6_J\360\357\262\370\277\374!cIo\221\'\206\340Lo4\356/\234f\221\331}\234\371\v\307\374)\303\025\256:&^{Y\226\276\026~\003,\255{\301\034lD\a\033\344\\hVb7MJ\200\257\222\024\231\t\355\307L\316\241\214\2005o.\306r}pQ\351\n9\376pu\305\312\262\350GQ\244\257Of,\267G\263v9\372\344\353$\360`-\332\\\032g1\377@b\236\314\337>\306\026/)\r\231\031z:}\211l\252\342\234`\365\031\001\276E\360\217\257^h\327\001\022~l\024|\206h\246\005n\032;\236\t)\032\265\300\344\316\b\0008\366\350\374\352\362\343\027\303rn\304Y\323r\245\2611\017\340I\356;A{\340\004\305\230\222\211\377e\202WGYT\346\023Xk\243\trJ\v\204%P\340\002\234\207\2504\365\310WD\315\266\"\224\371;\372s\201\334ys\255\206\235\343j1\302|\330\264\361\230\250\277]\371\356\020\314\232\200\024\3160\r\257\331[\027\021k\306\231\353\a<s\275]\036\217\357\236a?\227\335Y\243\026\236\206Fq\305\200\357\006\2028y\363\202\377\034\243M\235\317\314\375\233\031\333-\226\201\034~u\306\365\372\033@M\370!\v\271\214\222.\225004n=pi2B\005X\240#V\230\234w\336\350\214\224\310\034w\367S\266\266TNj%\265\026\331xz1\276\2735\370\035p\376O\024n\3451\256\346\034=\344\025\316G`\225\227\215\273\374\312\a.\332\245\274Iq\005\264\234(|\016\236\r\024\241\363\320\307A<m\216J\326\271{`\031\353\026\362\305\217\317N\273\017\036\241\217\354\024\'\2139m\211\227\337/\365\217\361\025\021.\247a\"\325\345\246\331\357\344\211\362\rD<2\035\365\033\277\260\230R\264\\\374N\203#\320\326\214\240G8\327q\300\257E\000ssm\002U\350\036l\344\bdz#a\276R8f&\032$\317\031\257\212\325\177H)/\030%\a\234D!$P\025n\246\321\273\021*\034\373p+f\341\252\363\177[\232\352\210\356\242>5\200)\237\226\335\253\036\021JZ\347t\346\344\334w$@CMl\003\374\273\210\274\002T\335.P\017\343\352\032\3570\243\270\304yY\t\275\377\023\376\243\r\317+\r\337\327\034.\214c\277&\205\223\211\321\362\256m\371\357\334\373\272g\356\255X\362\374\3117\326R\204\0203\254\335\314m{\021Fo\002\t\271\342\237\372\344\351\026\n\307D\201\363\361\002n+\302\204j\313\a\264b\224\371\206S\2012cz\357M\330\003\212s\215g\025\375\020#\005\002M\320\224\212o\262\035~\322\217%\235\364\355\311iE\334\266\002\233p}\210,\310\203\246\334f\214\a\377c\326\2701\2059\307\\\263\230]]\322\323\'+>\274\264\266\217\363\240\223\262\331\247\256\\d\323\371\362\315\027\b\315\026\225\235$\340\301+*o\266\341\233\230G \261Ri\266(\377M\226\276\201-\321)\362\262}\001\301\352\331KfX\227\254\275\a6\310\365l.\360\336\311\025\220\3722\200/\314l71\372a1\373z\375\016\n\270\017\tQ>\303\277\240R\220\t\374\350\035O\006\356= \213\002\f\273\320~&\021\375\227*\272UE\363\244{b\202BM\224\245DE^\\\\\343PiZ\2374o\a\rkG\217\365\364?\362u!\375\006R\217\345\354\244\262mS`9\232\360\vD>i$#\336]\303\322\245\f\0246&ZC\344Sn\230 iB\036M\276J4\203\344\016\003\254z\205\351&\312P\344\347>\273\261X\016\336\246\352\020\324\360& \334C\020\330\337$N\004e\210\273\216\333Hp\304g6L@:\206\312YL\203\001o\302u\307\261\345\210\375\2560\367\205\2018yL5H\211\025v\233\262\204\320K\214I\377\036\255\213xu{~t\274\346D\200\036\264p\270\243t8\372\376Z\352\371\237\000\250=\336GQ\372Z%\002\322\021\247\312\310\021xo\242:\363\203\367\032f\025^\215\204\316zB\327C8Y\036\027\216\200bI@W\360\204R\302\355\027\367\223\322\031C\222\353\\\320.\227s/\305(]\203E\312\273\255\016E\376\267\341\030\351\t\361\002\2153\2019B-\305\\\030o\230\376d\321Q\303\203;\261\327+\235\317_\274~\344\221\320\260R\033p\221WNH\213\225Q\027&\227\373\212\3249\212\302\347~\vU\"\002f\006#\001\224\333\032\222\365K\346b\366\236\230\333(\352\337\327}\337V1\221\262\205\026\'n\271Ou\311\232\321\027\251\305\231\003w\023\031\333s\024\361p\365\244D\274\265\200\227\003{\000\361\364\3264\264\357\301\342\222\350\'\257\264X\374\343[W\272\344\372\201\247w\313=\226\256h\v\"xs\223\001\251\avB\002\327\371\273g\004\236e\257\241\021\251\022\205\231\032\bH^I\375\330\251r~\300\234\266\317\004\255\f\