  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the **NORVA** scroll-driven isometric night-city hero experience as a single-file landing page and embedded it into the Android application and local environment.\n\n### What Was Built\n\n1. **NORVA Scroll-Driven Hero (`index.html` & `app/src/main/assets/index.html`)**:\n   - **Visuals & 3D Isometric Video**: Uses the 60 fps continuous camera glide clip over the graphite clay miniature city at night with glowing cyan route lines, workers, wind turbines, and hub building.\n   - **Typography & Responsive Unit System**: Inter Tight typography using `u = clamp(.72px, min(100vw/1440, 100vh/960), 1.5px)` (`u = 1px` on mobile screens $\\le 760\\text{px}$).\n   - **Color System**: NORVA night (`#0f1626`), ink (`#f4f6fa`), pill grey (`#2a3245`), lime (`#c6ff2e`), and cyan (`#3fd8ff`).\n   - **Fixed Navigation**: 3-column layout featuring \"OUR INDUSTRIES\" & \"OUR MISSION\" links, centred \"NORVA\" wordmark, and interactive \"APPLY\" and \"REQUEST CREWS\" pills with hover lift.\n   - **3D Perspective Headline Tilt**: Stage with `perspective: 900u` where the headline tilts backward into the dark city floor (`rotateX(62h deg)`, `translateY(-34h vh)`, `scale(1 - 0.12h)`) using an `easeInOutQuad` ease and fades out between $p = 0.10$ and $0.24$.\n   - **Scroll Cue**: Underline drains over the first 10% of scroll and fades out between $p = 0.04$ and $0.12$.\n   - **4-Step Process List**: Rises 40px and fades in between $p = 0.08$ and $0.24$. Step 01 expands below $p = 0.62$ and Step 02 activates above $p = 0.62$ with smooth grid-row accordion expansion and hairline border.\n   - **Full-Screen Loader**: Dual dashed/dotted elliptical orbits with 6 cyan squares in a ring and central lime chevron spinning every 1.6s, fading out smoothly upon video frame readiness.\n   - **Recorder Mode Support**: `?rec=1` URL parameter drives a precise 6.5s animation curve with `window.__recTime(video, t)` API.\n\n2. **Localhost & Development Server**:\n   - Running in the environment on `http://localhost:3000` (proxied directly through Nginx on port `8080` for web and external access).\n\n3. **Android Application & Custom Adaptive Launcher Icon**:\n   - `MainActivity.kt`: Hardware-accelerated Compose WebView rendering the complete single-file hero landing page with edge-to-edge support and smooth gesture handling.\n   - Custom adaptive launcher icon with isometric glowing hub graphics and matching `#0f1626` background across all mipmap densities.\n   - Verified with successful compilation and automated unit/Robolectric test suites."
    modified_response: "I have built the **NORVA** scroll-driven isometric night-city hero experience as a single-file landing page and embedded it into the Android application and local environment.\n\n### What Was Built\n\n1. **NORVA Scroll-Driven Hero (`index.html` & `app/src/main/assets/index.html`)**:\n   - **Visuals & 3D Isometric Video**: Uses the 60 fps continuous camera glide clip over the graphite clay miniature city at night with glowing cyan route lines, workers, wind turbines, and hub building.\n   - **Typography & Responsive Unit System**: Inter Tight typography using `u = clamp(.72px, min(100vw/1440, 100vh/960), 1.5px)` (`u = 1px` on mobile screens $\\le 760\\text{px}$).\n   - **Color System**: NORVA night (`#0f1626`), ink (`#f4f6fa`), pill grey (`#2a3245`), lime (`#c6ff2e`), and cyan (`#3fd8ff`).\n   - **Fixed Navigation**: 3-column layout featuring \"OUR INDUSTRIES\" & \"OUR MISSION\" links, centred \"NORVA\" wordmark, and interactive \"APPLY\" and \"REQUEST CREWS\" pills with hover lift.\n   - **3D Perspective Headline Tilt**: Stage with `perspective: 900u` where the headline tilts backward into the dark city floor (`rotateX(62h deg)`, `translateY(-34h vh)`, `scale(1 - 0.12h)`) using an `easeInOutQuad` ease and fades out between $p = 0.10$ and $0.24$.\n   - **Scroll Cue**: Underline drains over the first 10% of scroll and fades out between $p = 0.04$ and $0.12$.\n   - **4-Step Process List**: Rises 40px and fades in between $p = 0.08$ and $0.24$. Step 01 expands below $p = 0.62$ and Step 02 activates above $p = 0.62$ with smooth grid-row accordion expansion and hairline border.\n   - **Full-Screen Loader**: Dual dashed/dotted elliptical orbits with 6 cyan squares in a ring and central lime chevron spinning every 1.6s, fading out smoothly upon video frame readiness.\n   - **Recorder Mode Support**: `?rec=1` URL parameter drives a precise 6.5s animation curve with `window.__recTime(video, t)` API.\n\n2. **Localhost & Development Server**:\n   - Running in the environment on `http://localhost:3000` (proxied directly through Nginx on port `8080` for web and external access).\n\n3. **Android Application & Custom Adaptive Launcher Icon**:\n   - `MainActivity.kt`: Hardware-accelerated Compose WebView rendering the complete single-file hero landing page with edge-to-edge support and smooth gesture handling.\n   - Custom adaptive launcher icon with isometric glowing hub graphics and matching `#0f1626` background across all mipmap densities.\n   - Verified with successful compilation and automated unit/Robolectric test suites."
